*(Check off completed tasks with [x])*

### Phase 1: Environment & Base Policy (Completed)
- [x] **Docker Setup**: Base image, GPU/GUI config, `setup_env.sh` created.
- [x] **Simulator Setup**: LIBERO installed & `test_libero.py` verified (Headless).
